        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notes only records, transcribes and writes meeting notes without showing answer cards during the meeting. You can still ask Tacie questions. During a meeting, you can also switch modes from Tacie at the top of the screen."
